            "title": "Vulnerability description"
          },
          {
            "category": "summary",
            "text": "webkitgtk: Validate the full FeatureList array once in OpenTypeVerticalData findFeature",
            "title": "Vulnerability summary"
          },
          {
            "category": "other",
            "text": "To exploit this issue, an attacker needs to trick a user into processing or loading malicious web content. For this reason, this flaw has been rated with an important severity.\nAdditionally, this issue can cause memory corruption and the possibility of remote code execution is not discarded.",
            "title": "Statement"
