            "text": "A flaw was found in ANGLE, a component of Chromium. A remote attacker who has compromised the renderer process could exploit an out-of-bounds write vulnerability by crafting a malicious HTML page. This could potentially allow the attacker to escape the sandbox, leading to further system compromise.",
